## Notes: ZacUI world map, battlefield map and minimap markers. Replaces Leatrix Maps.
## Author: Zac
## Version: 3.0.9
## IconTexture: Interface\AddOns\ZacUI\Media\addonIcon
## X-Category: Interface Enhancements
## Dependencies: Zacui
## OptionalDeps: Leatrix_Maps, Questie
## X-ZacUI-Part: Maps

# Part of ZacUI. These files were lifted out of the main addon so this
# piece can be switched off in the AddOns list on its own. They share
# ZacUI's namespace (_G.ZacUI, published by Core_Boot) and its saved
# variables; every setting still lives in ZacUIDB and in profiles.
# Load order within this file is the same as it was inside ZacUI.

Maps_Data.lua
Maps_Core.lua
Maps_Pins.xml
Maps_Frame.lua
Maps_Skin.lua
Maps_Reveal.lua
Maps_HDTiles.lua
Maps_HD.lua
Maps_Icons.lua
Maps_Group.lua
Maps_Battlefield.lua
Maps_Module.lua
# Feature cluster 3 (2026-11-07): the game's own map fade (mapFade, through the
# CVar helper) and a dim behind the maximized map, off by default. After
# Maps_Module (it rides the module's apply).
Maps_GameFade.lua
Minimap_Pins.lua
Config_PagesMaps.lua
